WEBVTT

00:00:03.211 --> 00:00:07.110
A Media resource shares files of the media library.

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:10.121
Click Add Resource, then Add on Media.

00:00:10.605 --> 00:00:12.482
Fill in the same fields.

00:00:12.482 --> 00:00:17.426
In the Path, the placeholder path in curly braces stands for the location

00:00:17.426 --> 00:00:21.745
of a file in the media library, so an app can ask for any file.

00:00:22.212 --> 00:00:27.375
To share a single file instead, replace the placeholder with its location.

00:00:27.375 --> 00:00:28.472
Click Save.

